                <note rend="inline" type="source">875.6363/216: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Albania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kodding</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tirana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-07-20T16:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20, 1925—4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 21—5:53
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>48. Ratification Standard Oil Company’s concession in Albania completed
                    yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kodding</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
